                                                "sense_id": "8e41da97-92b1-3388-82ce-4e8e5fca3da1",
                                                "text": "At the Sphinx where he went rather sedately to play belotte and drink (with a timid air) an absinthe, which he hated, he had met a charming friend of his new wife [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
